<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguayan wheat output 400,000 tonnes - Chamber.</title>
<headline>Paraguayan wheat output 400,000 tonnes - Chamber.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguayan farmers harvested 400,000 tonnes of wheat in 1996, up 14 percent from last year, the Chamber of Cereals and Oilseeds said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The crop would have been more bountiful if not for heavy rains in October.</p>
<p>Paraguayan buyers should take 75 percent of the crop, while the rest will be exported to Brazil, The Chamber said.</p>
<p>Farmers sowed 220,000 hectares with wheat this season.</p>
<p>-- Asuncion Newsroom +59521 44-4527</p>
</text>
